Variable u
Variable v

Metavariable U:Frame
Metavariable V:Frame

Metavariable P:Statement
Metavariable Q:Statement

Rule (ExistentialIntroduction)
  Premises
    u is undefined 
    v is missing in P
    P[v for u]
    u is 𝘧𝘳𝘦𝘦 in P
  Conclusion
    ∃u P

Rule (ExistentialElimination)
  Premises
    u is undefined 
    v is missing in P
    ∃u P
    [P[v for u]] ... Q
    u is 𝘧𝘳𝘦𝘦 in P
  Conclusion
    Q
